#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:62
msgid "Diritto di recesso (UE 2023/2673)"
msgstr "Right of withdrawal (EU 2023/2673)"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:72
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hai esercitato il recesso per questo ordine il %s. Il rimborso è stato "
"effettuato."
msgstr ""
"You exercised your right of withdrawal for this order on %s. Your refund has "
"been processed."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:79
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hai esercitato il recesso per questo ordine il %s. L'ordine è stato "
"annullato. Il rimborso sarà elaborato nei prossimi 14 giorni lavorativi."
msgstr ""
"You returned this order on %s. The order has been cancelled. Your refund "
"will be processed within the next 14 business days."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:86
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hai esercitato il recesso per questo ordine il %s. La richiesta è stata "
"confermata dall'amministratore e il rimborso sarà elaborato nei prossimi 14 "
"giorni lavorativi."
msgstr ""
"You returned this order on %s. Your request has been confirmed by the "
"administrator, and your refund will be processed within the next 14 business "
"days."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:93
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hai richiesto il recesso per questo ordine il %s. La richiesta è in attesa "
"di conferma da parte dell'amministratore."
msgstr ""
"You requested a cancellation for this order on %s. Your request is pending "
"confirmation from the administrator."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:100
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hai già esercitato il recesso per questo ordine il %s. Il rimborso sarà "
"elaborato nei prossimi 14 giorni lavorativi."
msgstr ""
"You have already exercised your right of withdrawal for this order on %s. "
"Your refund will be processed within the next 14 business days."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:108
msgid "Il periodo di recesso di 14 giorni per questo ordine è scaduto."
msgstr "The 14-day cooling-off period for this order has expired."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:130
#: includes/emails/templates/euwb-customer-confirmation-plain.php:17
#: includes/emails/templates/euwb-customer-confirmation.php:23
#: includes/emails/templates/euwb-customer-intent-plain.php:17
#: includes/emails/templates/euwb-customer-intent.php:23
msgid "Istruzioni per la restituzione del bene"
msgstr "Instructions for returning the goods"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:140
msgid "Nome *"
msgstr "Name *"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:142
msgid "Cognome *"
msgstr "Surname *"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:145
msgid "Indirizzo e-mail *"
msgstr "Email address *"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:147
msgid "Motivo del recesso (facoltativo)"
msgstr "Reason for withdrawal (optional)"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:148
msgid "Puoi lasciare vuoto questo campo."
msgstr "You can leave this field blank."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:154
msgid ""
"Cliccando sopra avvierai la procedura di recesso. Nel passaggio successivo "
"ti verrà chiesta conferma."
msgstr ""
"Clicking above will start the cancellation process. In the next step, you "
"will be asked for confirmation."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:160
msgid "Sei sicuro di voler recedere dal contratto?"
msgstr "Are you sure you want to withdraw from the contract?"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:161
msgid ""
"Cliccando \"Conferma recesso qui\" invierai la dichiarazione di recesso. "
"Riceverai un'email di conferma."
msgstr ""
"By clicking \"Confirm withdrawal here,\" you will submit your withdrawal "
"declaration. You will receive a confirmation email."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:164
msgid "Conferma recesso qui"
msgstr "Confirm withdrawal here"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:167
msgid "Annulla"
msgstr "Cancel"

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:191 includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:196
#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:228 includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:233
msgid "Non autorizzato."
msgstr "Unauthorized."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:200 includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:237
msgid "Il periodo di recesso è scaduto."
msgstr "The withdrawal period has expired."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:201 includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:238
msgid "Hai già richiesto il recesso per questo ordine."
msgstr "You have already requested a return for this order."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:208 includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:248
msgid "Compila tutti i campi obbligatori."
msgstr "Please fill in all required fields."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:255
msgid ""
"Recesso confermato con successo. Riceverai un'email di conferma. Il rimborso "
"sarà elaborato nei prossimi giorni lavorativi."
msgstr ""
"Your return has been successfully confirmed. You will receive a confirmation "
"email. Your refund will be processed within the next few business days."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:258
msgid ""
"Richiesta di recesso inviata con successo. Riceverai un'email di conferma. "
"L'amministratore elaborerà il rimborso nei prossimi giorni lavorativi."
msgstr ""
"Your refund request has been sent successfully. You will receive a "
"confirmation email. The administrator will process your refund within the "
"next few business days."

#: includes/class-euwb-frontend.php:261
msgid ""
"Impossibile registrare la richiesta di recesso. Riprova o contatta il "
"supporto."
msgstr ""
"Your cancellation request could not be registered. Please try again or "
"contact support."

#: includes/class-euwb-withdrawal.php:77
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Recesso richiesto dal cliente (ID recesso: %d). In attesa di conferma da "
"parte dell'amministratore."
msgstr ""
"Withdrawal requested by customer (Withdrawal ID: %d). Awaiting confirmation "
"from the administrator."

#: includes/class-euwb-withdrawal.php:123
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Recesso confermato dal cliente ai sensi della Direttiva UE 2023/2673 (ID "
"recesso: %d)."
msgstr ""
"Withdrawal confirmed by the customer pursuant to EU Directive 2023/2673 "
"(Withdrawal ID: %d)."

#: includes/class-euwb-withdrawal.php:158
msgid ""
"Recesso confermato dall'amministratore ai sensi della Direttiva UE "
"2023/2673. In attesa di rimborso."
msgstr ""
"Withdrawal confirmed by the administrator pursuant to EU Directive "
"2023/2673. Refund pending."

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-confirmation.php:9
msgid "Recesso EU – Conferma"
msgstr "EU Withdrawal – Confirmation"

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-confirmation.php:10
msgid ""
"Inviata al cliente quando il recesso è confermato definitivamente (flusso "
"standard e diretto)."
msgstr ""
"Sent to the customer when the withdrawal is definitively confirmed (standard "
"and direct flow)."

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-confirmation.php:11
msgid "Il tuo recesso è stato confermato"
msgstr "Your withdrawal has been confirmed"

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-intent.php:9
msgid "Recesso EU – Richiesta ricevuta"
msgstr "EU Withdrawal – Request Received"

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-intent.php:10
msgid ""
"Inviata al cliente quando la richiesta di recesso è registrata e in attesa "
"di conferma admin."
msgstr ""
"Sent to the customer when the withdrawal request is registered and awaiting "
"admin confirmation."

#: includes/emails/class-euwb-email-customer-intent.php:11
msgid "Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta di recesso"
msgstr "We have received your withdrawal request"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://example.com/eu-withdrawal-button"
msgstr "https://example.com/eu-withdrawal-button"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Implements the EU mandatory withdrawal button as required by Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673, effective 19 June 2026. Adds a compliant withdrawal function to "
"WooCommerce order pages with email notifications and a full audit log."
msgstr ""
"Implements the EU mandatory withdrawal button as required by Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673, effective 19 June 2026. Adds a compliant withdrawal function to "
"WooCommerce order pages with email notifications and a full audit log."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Marco D'Agostino, ContrattiDigitaliOnline"
msgstr "Marco D'Agostino, DigitalContractsOnline"
